n for forensic science. One day at school there is a commotion outside the music room and something is missing. Riz recruits her friends, Jenny, Sabrina, Lachie A and Lochie C and breaks out her fingerprint tools. Is it more than a misunderstanding? How can they work out what happened when no one will even tell them what is missing? And is the mark left behind in the music room really a fingerprint? Join the five friends as they recruit some extras to take fingerprints from everyone who might have gone into the music room and find a potential suspect. ","maxAge":10,"minAge":5,"abridged":false,"authors":[],"narrators":[],"accents":["AU English"],"copyrights":["©"],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/l-o-cj2oRrjCJTeQnQkOnUud5FPCpXR6v0Ez0ZDTYW4"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":4111,"fileSize":66524434}},"slug":"ltso705KnCAozQ5FZqodC","title":"Riz Chester: The Fingerprint Code","userId":"yoto","cardId":"hoUCr","createdAt":"2026-02-06T10:18:58.534Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-08T21:43:47.110Z","clubAvailability":[],"sortkey":"ltso705KnCAozQ5FZqodC"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":true,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":false}}